<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/msa@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/msa@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Walau apa pun subseksyen (3), seseorang warganegara yang menerima apa-apa anugerah asing—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/msa@> .
